Z||000000||CoolBlue87GT||12-27-2001||10:38 AM||||From my '74 Hornet - My first car !<BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/junk7.jpg"> <BR>(Yes, old pic) The headers ran 3 cyl per side.<P>Had custom 3" pipe run thru 'Hush Thrush' mufflers (not sure if company exists anymore)<P>Sounded nice any any speed.  Only wished it was not an automatic. Oh I miss that car.<P>Many "1st" happened in that car !! (was a hatchback)<p>[This message has been edited by CoolBlue87GT (edited 12-27-2001).]||||reg||5
